{"study_accession":"PRJNA682651","secondary_study_accession":"SRP296028","title":"Follicular helper-like T cells in the lung highlight a novel role of B cells in sarcoidosis","description":"Effector/memory T cells were sorted from sarcoidosis patient's bronchoalveolar lavage (BAL) and peripheral blood (PBMC) as well as healthy donor peripheral blood and tonsil. RNA-sequencing was performed to assess their global phenotype. Total number of samples: 15. Overall design: T cells from BAL (4 samples), tonsil (2 samples) and PBMC (3 patients and 3 healthy donor controls) were sorted on an ARIA II flow sorter (Becton Dickinson) as DAPI- CD14- CD16- CD19- CD3+ CD4+ CD45RA- CD45RO+. Tonsillar T cell were further sorted for CXCR5/PD-1 double-positive or -negative to discriminate Tfh and non-Tfh cells. RNA was isolated using a Qiagen (Hilden, Germany) RNeasy Micro Kit.","pubmed":"34534436","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN17005292","study_accession":"PRJNA682651","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Blood patient 18","description":"Blood patient 18","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4957781","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-09-09","attributes":[["source_name","peripheral blood"],["tissue","peripheral blood"],["patient diagnosis","sarcoidosis"],["donor","18"],["cell_line","CD4+ CD45RO+ T cells"],["condition","CD4+ effector/memory"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR13201059","experiment_accession":"SRX9634538","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":11055939,"base_count":1653891546,"first_public":"2021-09-09","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM4957781: Blood patient 18 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN17005293","study_accession":"PRJNA682651","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Blood patient 14","description":"Blood patient 14","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4957780","access":"open","dbgap":"",